Current:
```kotlin
        if (find("PS3_DISC.SFB")?.isFile == true) return true
        find("PS3_GAME")?.takeIf { it.isDirectory }?.let { gameDir ->
            val inner = runCatching { gameDir.listFiles() }.getOrNull().orEmpty()
            if (inner.any { it.isFile && it.name.equals("PARAM.SFO", ignoreCase = true) } &&
                hasBootableEboot()
            ) return true
        }
        return find("PARAM.SFO")?.isFile == true &&
            find("USRDIR")?.isDirectory == true &&
            hasBootableEboot()
```

Let me change to mirror:
```kotlin
        val sfo = find("PS3_GAME")?.takeIf { it.isDirectory }?.let { gameDir ->
            runCatching { gameDir.listFiles() }.getOrNull().orEmpty()
                .firstOrNull { it.isFile && it.name.equals("PARAM.SFO", ignoreCase = true) }
        } ?: find("PARAM.SFO")?.takeIf { it.isFile }
        if (sfo == null) {
            return find("PS3_DISC.SFB")?.isFile == true && hasBootableEboot()
        }
        return hasBootableEboot()
```

